description=Unified tuning: TCP bbr+congestion, fastopen=3, somaxconn=4096, swappiness=100, min_free#=16384, dirty 15/3, page-cluster=0, BFQ sched, readahead=512, KSM on, THP khugepaged relaxed. Applied after boot storm. rollback: touch /data/perftune.rollback + reboot